{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53213","headline":"诗偈 三十八 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 三十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我观三界有，有人披草舍。\n虵鼠同穴住，白日恒如夜。\n鸠鸽爲亲情，罗刹同心话。\n五狗常嘷吠，思之令人怕。\n我观总是幻，虚空名亦假。\n放牛吃草庵，三生同一化。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}